sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Your app
    participant SDK as Client SDK
    participant C as Your contract
    participant TM as TaskManager
    participant ZK as ZK Verifier
    participant Pipe as Compute pipeline
    participant CR as CommitmentRegistry

    App->>SDK: encryptInputs([...]).setConsumingContract(addr).execute()
    SDK->>SDK: encrypt with TFHE, generate zkPoKs
    SDK->>ZK: ciphertext batch + proofs
    ZK->>ZK: verify the proofs in the attested TEE
    ZK->>ZK: store the ciphertext bytes in CT Server
    ZK-->>SDK: handles + one batch signature
    SDK-->>App: [handles..., proof]
    App->>C: contract call with handles + proof
    C->>TM: batchVerifyInputs
    TM->>TM: verify the batch signature
    TM--)Pipe: InputVerified per input
    Pipe->>CR: postCommitments (batched)
